edits_description = "The lamps and some of the people were removed."
final_image_tex = SubResource("Resource_5vv68")
blurb = "Depicts a food stall in a village in Malacca, Malaysia, warmly lit by incandescent lamps, and surrounded by coconut palms.

Several figures in traditional Malay garments and wearing turbans and songkok hats are gathered at the front. A woman holding a baby can be seen in the window above.

The stall has a raised veranda and a traditional thatched roof made from nipa palm leaves. Bananas hang from the eaves."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://6kpsqyb2pk7a"
